{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo codes for orders and subscription upgrades using one shared pricing helper. Percentage discounts round half-up to whole cents, fixed discounts are capped at the pre-tax subtotal, and tax applies to the discounted amount. For upgrades, the promo applies after proration.\n\nInvalid registrations, unknown or stacked codes, unmet minimums, and invalid expiry dates raise `ValidationError` before a charge is recorded. Upgrade retries include `promo_code` and `as_of` in the idempotency check.\n\nAdded six promo tests. `run_checks.py` exited **0** with all **16 tests passing**."}}
